ns remained disrupted, though some efficiencies emerged through diversification.  Food security became a serious concern in North Africa and the Middle East, increasing instability in already fragile regions. The cost of living crisis deepened, disproportionately impacting low-income households. Geopolitical alignment solidified—a clearer divide between pro-Western and anti-Western blocs. Renewed focus on energy\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":24}]}